# Plumecreed Mentor: "Whenever this creature or another creature you control with flying enters, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you
# control without flying." On turn 1 the Mentor's own entering (CR 603.6a) puts a counter on Bot1's Memnite (its only legal target: the
# Mentor itself has flying), and so does Bot1's Ornithopter entering with flying; Bot1's second Memnite (no flying) and Bot2's Ornithopter
# (not Bot1's creature) cause no trigger, so Memnite#1 ends with exactly two counters and Memnite#2 none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Memnite x2
Ornithopter
Plumecreed Mentor
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

